          "prompt": "Inspect the wrapper:\n```python\ndef decorate(function):\n    def inner_function():\n        return function()\n    return inner_function\n```\nWhat happens when the returned wrapper is later called?",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "option1",
              "text": "inner_function calls the supplied function and returns its result."
            },
